Broker portal judged at 390px/1366px against the Amazon/Uber bar (docs/ux-audit-2026-09/HANDOFF.md):
- Dashboard: payables = one slim row per unpaid trip + "Review & pay N trips" (full ledger stays in Invoices);
  My loads = newest two + "View all loads".
- Card heads: title beside its icon (was pushed right on every card). Pills wrap (Requests overflowed the phone).
- Phone top bar: page title no longer truncated to two letters.
- Sign-up: Terms/Privacy notice, 8-char minimum, no "Forgot password?" in sign-up mode, human error messages.
- Chat teaser: portals tease only when signed in; brokers/shippers/agents no longer get the carrier promise.
- Expired load shows "Expired", not "Posted"; duplicate payables icon removed.

